    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick GIFs and web content directly to your desktop \u2014 even over fullscreen games.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the App</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staxxi lets you pin animated GIFs and websites anywhere on your screen and keep them visible no matter what you\u2019re doing. Whether you're watching a video while gaming, displaying Twitch chat, or just adding some visual flair, Staxxi gives you full control over what stays on top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick GIFs and web content directly to your desktop \u2014 even over fullscreen games.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the App</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staxxi lets you pin animated GIFs and websites anywhere on your screen and keep them visible no matter what you\u2019re doing. Whether you're watching a video while gaming, displaying Twitch chat, or just adding some visual flair, Staxxi gives you full control over what stays on top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Pin GIFs to your desktop Built-in web browser to display websites (YouTube, Discord, etc.) Always-on-top mode \u2014 media stays visible over fullscreen apps and games Controls for size, rotation, and opacity Hotkeys to lock, unlock, or hide everything Lightweight for minimal resource usage",
